{% if part == "LyricsWikifonia" %}\lyricmode {
	As I _ walked out in the streets of La -- re -- do, As I __ walked out in La -- re -- do
	one day, I spied a young cow -- boy all wrapped in white lin -- en, All wrapped in white
	lin -- en and cold as the clay. "'Then" beat the drum slow -- ly, play the fife low -- ly,
	Play the dead march as you car -- ry me a -- "long;" Take me to the green val -- ley, lay
	the sod o'er me, I'm a young cow -- boy and I know I've done wrong.
}
{% endif %}
